  "description": "Ajin has a secret: the moment his lips touch someone else’s, he can see their past lives. Now twenty and trying to navigate the adult world, he meets Jinwu, a strikingly handsome guy at a club who isn't shy about making a move. Charmed by Jinwu’s bold and persistent flirting, Ajin finds himself falling for him. But as their connection deepens, how much longer would Ajin be able to guard his lips from the guy who’s determined to steal his heart?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
